sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as Flask API
    participant OSV as OSV.dev API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>FE: Enter project name, choose requirements.txt / package.json
    FE->>API: POST /api/parse (file)
    API->>API: Validate and extract package names + versions
    alt Invalid or unsupported file
        API-->>FE: 400 error message
        FE-->>User: Show error
    else Valid file
        API-->>FE: Dependencies + skipped entries
        FE-->>User: Preview of extracted packages
    end

    User->>FE: Click "Scan Dependencies"
    FE->>API: POST /api/scan (project name, dependencies)
    API->>OSV: POST /v1/querybatch (all packages + versions)
    OSV-->>API: Vulnerability IDs per package
    loop Each unique vulnerability ID
        API->>OSV: GET /v1/vulns/{id}
        OSV-->>API: Severity, description, affected ranges, fixed versions
    end

    alt OSV.dev unreachable
        API-->>FE: 502 error
        FE-->>User: Show error (nothing saved)
    else Scan succeeded
        API->>DB: insert project
        API->>DB: upsert vulnerabilities
        API->>DB: insert dependencies (with vulnerability references)
        DB-->>API: Saved
        API-->>FE: 201 project_id
    end

    FE->>API: GET /api/results?project_id=...
    API->>DB: find dependencies of project
    DB-->>API: Documents
    API-->>FE: Result rows
    FE-->>User: Results table (filters + search)

    User->>FE: Click a vulnerability
    FE->>API: GET /api/vulnerabilities/{id}
    API->>DB: find vulnerability document
    DB-->>API: Details
    API-->>FE: Description, affected + fixed versions
    FE-->>User: Detail view

    User->>FE: Open Dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /api/dashboard
    API->>DB: aggregate counts and severity distribution
    DB-->>API: Totals
    API-->>FE: Statistics
    FE-->>User: Cards + severity chart
